  "details": "Accessibility option to disable all UI effects\n\nReason: All the different nameplate effects on the nameplates and Launch Pad makes it too overwhelming and gives me a headache, especially when scrolling through multiple different nameplates of different effects trying to find a friend in our friends list, or trying to find a friends nameplate in a crowded club instance\n\nAt the very least, an option to have the nameplate effects only show when you hover over their name in the friends menu like Discord does with their nameplates.",
